1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,280
MEN: Hello, Ms. Maxwell. You wanted me to visit to talk about something?

2
00:00:04,280 --> 00:00:09,250
WOMAN: That's correct. I need to talk about the tenants upstairs in the unit above me.

3
00:00:09,250 --> 00:00:12,230
They keep making too much noise late at night.

4
00:00:12,230 --> 00:00:17,040
MEN: I see. Have you spoken with them in person to request that they be quieter?

5
00:00:17,040 --> 00:00:18,863
WOMAN: I have, but that didn't work.

6
00:00:18,863 --> 00:00:23,290
They still listen to music and play the guitar at all hours of the day and night.

7
00:00:23,290 --> 00:00:29,280
MEN: Okay, I'd better pay a visit to 4C and have a talk with them. When I'm done

8
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:30,270
I'll come back down here.

9
00:00:30,270 --> 00:00:34,240
WOMAN: Thanks. I really appreciate your assistance.
